tasks-harp-id-required = a task needs a harp id
tasks-not-its-stream = task { $harp_id } does not belong in this stream
tasks-no-root = task { $harp_id } has no stream to belong in: its root cannot be derived ({ $cause })
tasks-task-exists = task { $harp_id } already exists
tasks-no-task = there is no such task
tasks-removed = task { $harp_id } was removed
tasks-text-required = a task needs text
tasks-status-required = a status change needs a status, a trigger, or the trigger cleared
tasks-status-reserved = the status { $status } is not allowed: '@' is reserved for status classes
tasks-trigger-required = a Deferred task needs a trigger: the condition that should revive it
tasks-tag-required = a retag needs at least one tag
tasks-blank = the { $field } given is blank: give one, or leave it out
tasks-trigger-with-status = a trigger defers the task to { $defers }, so it cannot be given with the status { $status }: give the trigger alone, or the status alone
tasks-unresolved = the command carries no { $field } status: the application resolves it from the configured statuses
